KPL/IK 

Hayabusa2 NIRS3 Instrument kernel
==============================================================================

  This instrument kernel (I-kernel) file contains detector, optical, and
  field-of-view parameters for the Hayabusa2 Near Infrared Spectrometer
  (NIRS3) instrument.


